      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003EFOR TO MAKE BUKKENADE\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nNym good fresh flesch what maner so it be and hew it in small morselys and seth it with goode fresh beef and cast thereto goode minced onyons and goode spicerye and ally with eyryn [eggs] and boyle and dresse it forth.\u003Cbr\u003E"
